## Context

The ticket0765 /roar sweep at merged main c5ca8ae3ee5d6bf72d1c56406a7c8512d88ee003 found a remaining output-safety instance in scripts/jetp/build_vnm_positions.py:131. Its _country_output accepts a JSON object with the exact country-migration top-level fields but empty source/evidence objects, empty inventory/legacy lists, and six empty MVP view objects. A probe executed the file read from origin/main and returned True. write_migration then treats this unrelated descriptor as permission to replace it.

PR1376 hardened the South African counterpart against this empty lookalike. The Vietnam lexical symlink/hardlink guard from PR1371 already works; retain it. The defect here is incomplete predecessor recognition, not a reason to alter source migrations, canonical publication, or accepted source data. It meets the state-corruption floor because an unrelated existing file can be overwritten.

## First test

Write a top-level-shaped but empty VNM candidate descriptor at an existing .json destination. Monkeypatch the builder to fail if entered. Calling write_migration must reject the destination before building and preserve its exact bytes. On current main the recognizer returns True, so the regression must first fail. Include a real recognized candidate rerun control; VNM record_count is 24 while the public detail list contains three projects, so do not equate these fields.

## Actions

Require the bounded populated source/evidence, inventory, legacy disposition, and MVP structures produced by the Vietnam migration before granting replacement permission. Reuse the shared lexical replacement guard before path resolution. Add a standing parameterized country-writer regression so empty lookalikes, malformed members and aliases cannot return through later migrations, while real candidate reruns and interruption preservation remain valid.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Empty and malformed VNM predecessor lookalikes are rejected before the builder and preserve destination bytes.
- [ ] A complete real VNM candidate remains replaceable; its public summary/detail semantics are unchanged.
- [ ] Country-writer regression coverage includes ZAF and VNM empty lookalikes, lexical symlink/hardlink aliases, valid reruns and interrupted builds.
- [ ] Canonical CSVs, accepted MVP views, baseline archive and candidate recovery remain unchanged except necessary recipe provenance updates.

## Validation and recovery

Start RED, commit GREEN, run focused country-writer and migration checks, make check-fast and make lint, and the required pipeline gate under AGENTS.md. If the stored candidate recipe changes, regenerate its DVC sidecar and verify independent recovery. No publication or ownership transfer. Parent migration tracker0760 remains open. Discovery: PR1376 roar, 14 September 2026.
